# languages/dotnet/runtime, a library of ix's tools (mkfiles/mklib):
# what mini-dotnet's interpreter and JIT stand on, Value (the types and
# values), Library (System's classes, over lib_core) and Types (the
# loader), over the assembly's tables (languages/dotnet/assembly).
# mini-csc links it too, for Value and Library, which it compiled
# itself before, by rules in its mkfile (plan_simpler_builds.md, step 4).
TOP=../../..
<$TOP/mkfiles/mkconfig
LIB=languages/dotnet/runtime
DIRS=.
NEEDS=languages/dotnet/assembly
UNITS=Value Library Types
<$TOP/mkfiles/mklib
